<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Johan year net 33.82 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Johan year net 33.82 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  33.82   vs	  33.12</p>
<p>    Group share  (cents)    11.02   vs	  10.79</p>
<p>    Turnover		   876.36   vs	 698.34</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    40.64   vs	  40.42</p>
<p>    Minorities		   1.08   vs	   2.88</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 2.50   vs	   2.25</p>
<p>NOTE - Johan Holdings Bhd is involved in property, and manufacturing and marketing of engineering products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
